{% call m.note("How to read these pages", 2) %}
<p>These pages ask the same questions of every option, including keeping the present rule. Where the evidence is strong, they say so. Where a claim is a recommendation or a value judgement, they say whose it is. They recommend no option.</p>
{% endcall %}

