<p>{{ ("tl-kept-to-2030" | claim).statement }} {{ ("rule-2030" | claim).statement }} {{ ("ncs-savings-used" | claim).statement }} {{ m.c("rule-2030") }}</p>
<p>This is an announcement. It is not law. {{ ("rule-2030-legislate" | claim).statement }} The options on this page are still the ones to compare, and <a href="#opt-2030">the announced rule</a> is now one of them. <a href="/reform-options/social-care/">Pensions and social care</a> sets out the plan and what it leaves open.</p>
